### Workflow API samples

@host = https://localhost:5001
@inst = 0c250000-50bf-11e7-89e2-1cbdb9e7fd04

### Init email_generic
GET {{host}}/api/connect/workflow/init?title=email_generic
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}

### Init sms_generic
GET {{host}}/api/connect/workflow/init?title=sms_generic
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}

### Index
GET {{host}}/api/connect/workflow
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}

### Push workflow payload
POST {{host}}/api/connect/workflow
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "email_generic",
  "step": 1,
  "payload": {}
}
